ul.li:
An audience, which says whose view of the docs it reads:


staff: everything, with conditional content labelled, any live release line;

one org: exactly what that org's readers see, on their release line;

public: what anonymous visitors see; only on public sites.

          Every answer goes through the same filtering as the site, so a key never sees a topic, title, link,
          image or search hit its audience could not.
